ZOE | Science & Nutrition on Instagram: "What’s the most underrated thing you can do for your health, according to two world-leading experts?

@drwilliamli is a world-renowned physician, scientist, bestselling author, and President and Medical Director of the Angiogenesis Foundation.

@tim.spector is Professor of Epidemiology at King’s College London, one of the world’s top 100 most cited scientists, and ZOE’s scientific co-founder.

From the health advice they wish more people followed to the wellness trends they think deserve a rethink, we’re getting their take on some of today’s biggest health questions.

And if you’re heading to @eudemoniasummit in West Palm Beach this weekend, come and say hello to the ZOE team. We’ll be catching up with @dr.fede.amati and @drwilliamli to bring you more of the latest insights."
